=6a97da376cba5af48b2db15f0a2adf8d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d930e1f2/uploads/origins/5a196d07-e92e-44ff-8603-376bd6e84ee1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6a97da376cba5af48b2db15f0a2adf8d, https://si.imgix.net/d930e1f2/uploads/origins/5a196d07-e92e-44ff-8603-376bd6e84ee1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=70c8ed25e5a6143f6191076888944f28 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d930e1f2/uploads/origins/5a196d07-e92e-44ff-8603-376bd6e84ee1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=80c39a1e7acc59c9b75273d7f5437965 3x"}, "body": "Hello らくりつさん, it's nice to meet you. Thank you for the appeal! らくりつさん's illustrations are wonderful. I'd be happy if I could request an illustration of my character <Regulus> like stated in the appeal.\n\nhttps://www.deviantart.com/stash/2108ltb60mpu\n\nPlease view Regulus's images at the above URL.\n\nRegulus is an inventor with the appearance of a young boy. He has fluffy hair and often has a slightly sleepy expression on his face.\n\nI will leave the pose and composition up to you. I'd be happy if his whole body could be drawn like stated in the appeal.\n\nIf possible, please deliver a PSD file with the sign layer separate from the illustration. Thank you for your consideration.", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Luckryth/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3771820, "client_id": 897326, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6f84df86/uploads/origins/1ca6910a-bbbe-4d5f-a04f-bbce4d4c3023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=523c215d53fd688648d27583702aa249", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6f84df86/uploads/origins/1ca6910a-bbbe-4d5f-a04f-bbce4d4c3023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=523c215d53fd688648d27583702aa249, https://si.imgix.net/6f84df86/uploads/origins/1ca6910a-bbbe-4d5f-a04f-bbce4d4c3023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02fc741add11bc7f06c2adb01efc1797 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6f84df86/uploads/origins/1ca6910a-bbbe-4d5f-a04f-bbce4d4c3023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a22a1eea0f1a0c53247dc91c65ced647 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6f84df86/uploads/origins/1ca6910a-bbbe-4d5f-a04f-bbce4d4c3023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3183407e6e0641552580b58f1294d282", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6f84df86/uploads/origins/1ca6910a-bbbe-4d5f-a04f-bbce4d4c3023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3183407e6e0641552580b58f1294d282, https://si.imgix.net/6f84df86/uploads/origins/1ca6910a-bbbe-4d5f-a04f-bbce4d4c3023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a41c5b9446d248bc2d463d6c5dfdb267 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6f84df86/uploads/origins/1ca6910a-bbbe-4d5f-a04f-bbce4d4c3023?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=94587fc0c1b3021cf97c798fae5eabf8 3x"}, "body": "はじめまして！先日はアピールをありがとうございました！\nそれでは、御指名いただきました当方のOC(うちの子)「葉可世 麻矢(はかせ・まや)」をリクエストさせていただきます。\n何卒、宜しくお願い申し上げます…。\n\n＊人物\n名前：葉可世 麻矢(はかせ・まや)\n性別：女\n年齢：23歳\n国籍：日本\n通称「ハカセちゃん」。「こんなこともあろうかと」系の超天才科学者。飛び級で機械工学と生化学の博士号および医師免許(専門は精神科)を取得。ホワイトハッカーとしての技術にも長け、人文系の教養も持ち合わせるチートさん(そういう世界なのですw)。口癖は「ふむ…」。温厚かつ超然とした性格で、滅多なことでは取り乱したりしません。\n\n＊外見\n髪色のベースはローズグレイ(RGB:157-137-137)。髪型は「大正モダンガールみたいにするつもりが、ワカメちゃん風おかっぱになっちゃった」という感じの刈り上げ短髪・オン眉ぱっつん。\n特に困っていなくても下がり気味の眉、丸い目の瞳は一般的な黒、低めの鼻。\n身長158cm、バスト80cm(Aカップ)…中肉中背、色気皆無のスレンダーボディ。服の上からでは、胸の膨らみは分からない程度の慎ましさ。\n\n＊服装\n使い込んだ白衣、V字ネックのカットソー(色はお任せします)、洒落っ気無しの黒縁眼鏡。下半身の描写は必須ではありませんが、パンツスタイルです。\n左胸ポケットには、愛用の万年筆とタッチペン。\n\n＊その他\nポーズや表情、背景はお任せします。\n\n長文かつ詳細な内容で、誠に申し訳ございません…御検討いただけますと大変有難く存じます。\n\nhttps://z.wikiwiki.jp/uchinoko/topic/50", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 44487, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "不寝@skeb募集中", "screen_name": "asgnez", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1645475046776012800/pCvAoRKs.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1004041971856363520/1758804395/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 1}, {"id": 2261817, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "URAめし skeb", "screen_name": "power_gogogo", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1848298109945978880/gnXuiFP7.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1509883581841108996/1713749150/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 45, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "novel"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 2548325, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "笹竹🎋", "screen_name": "_kmss_1", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1895138074063183875/FFrMylnQ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1399910963000741893/1681960177/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_e